<title>HONG KONG: Truly Int'l 1996 net down 22.6 percent.</title>
<headline>Truly Int'l 1996 net down 22.6 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   15.8   vs 21.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    2.0    vs 2.5</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    65.07  vs 84.12</p>
<p>    Turnover		     465.22 vs 523.48</p>
<p>    Company name		 Truly International Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  April 30 to May 6</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   May 20</p>
<p>NOTE - Truly makes electronic calculators.</p>
<p>Total dividend for the year is 3.5 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of 1.5 cents) vs 4.5 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
